  "status_rationale": "KVFS-108 captured hermetic baselines; KVFS-801 freezes reviewed absolute floors for performance, chaos, saturation, and resource-leak release gates. Floors cannot be lowered in the same change that fails them. Performance claims must not weaken correctness, durability, permissions, or cache coherence.",
